  <revision rev="12" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>1775c51e3309d57dc6ec1dd40882cbd4</srcmd5>
    <version>2.3.0</version>
    <time>1793300714</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- updated to 2.3.0
   see /usr/share/doc/packages/perl-Dancer2/Changes
  2.3.0     2026-10-26 19:55:58-04:00 America/New_York
      [ SECURITY ]
      * PR #1866: JSON serializer should not leak file/line detail
        (Russell @veryrusty Jenkins)
      [ BUG FIXES ]
      * GH #1794: Add support for HTTP QUERY method. Old style plugins that
        register query will die at load, and apps with their own sub query
        will get a redefine warning. (Mohammad S Anwar)
      * PR #1845: Fix Windows-only test failures (David Precious)
      * GH #1861: Fix numbers being serialized to JSON as strings. The UTF-8
        scan in Dancer2::Serializer::JSON gave numeric values a string form,
        which JSON::XS and JSON::PP before 2.97 then encoded as quoted strings.
        (David Precious)
      * GH #1863: Fix the JSON serializer modifying the data it is given.
        Hash keys needing UTF-8 decoding were deleted from the caller's hash,
        losing those entries, and arrayrefs were decoded in place.
        (David Precious)
      [ ENHANCEMENTS ]
      * None
      [ DOCUMENTATION ]
      * None
      [ DEPRECATED ]
      * None
      [ MISC ]
      * None</comment>
